		(uuid "f7d89ebf-30fd-48ec-b57f-8d6d5101947a")
	)
	(text "VCELL = 3.6V (nominal) | RDSON = 1.45 ohm (min) to 4.6 ohm (max)\nSizing eq:  RCB = 0.5 * (VCELL/ICB - RDSON)\nPower eq: P = ICB^2 * RCB\n\n--- 200mA TARGET ---\nSize (RDSON=4.6 max):\n  RCB = 0.5 * (3.6/0.200 - 4.6)\n  RCB = 0.5 * (18.0 - 4.6)\n  RCB = 0.5 * 13.4\n  RCB = 6.7 ohm  -->  USE 6.8 ohm (E24 std)\n\nPower @ RDSON=1.45 (worst case, min RDSON = max current = max power):\n  ICB = 3.6 / (2*6.8 + 1.45)\n  ICB = 3.6 / (13.6 + 1.45)\n  ICB = 3.6 / 15.05\n  ICB = 0.2392 A = 239.2 mA\n  P = (0.2392)^2 * 6.8\n  P = 0.05722 * 6.8\n  P = 0.389 W\n\nRESULT: RCB = 6.8 ohm | P = 0.389 W | Min rated power (60% derate) = 0.389/0.6 = 0.648 W\n\n--- 240mA TARGET ---\nSize (RDSON=4.6 max):\n  RCB = 0.5 * (3.6/0.240 - 4.6)\n  RCB = 0.5 * (15.0 - 4.6)\n  RCB = 0.5 * 10.4\n  RCB = 5.2 ohm  -->  USE 5.1 ohm (E24 std)\n\nPower @ RDSON=1.45 (worst case):\n  ICB = 3.6 / (2*5.1 + 1.45)\n  ICB = 3.6 / (10.2 + 1.45)\n  ICB = 3.6 / 11.65\n  ICB = 0.3090 A = 309.0 mA\n  P = (0.3090)^2 * 5.1\n  P = 0.09548 * 5.1\n  P = 0.487 W\n\nRESULT: RCB = 5.1 ohm | P = 0.487 W | Min rated power (60% derate) = 0.487/0.6 = 0.812 W\n\n--- 385mA TARGET ---\nSize (RDSON=4.6 max):\n  RCB = 0.5 * (3.6/0.385 - 4.6)\n  RCB = 0.5 * (9.351 - 4.6)\n  RCB = 0.5 * 4.751\n  RCB = 2.38 ohm  -->  USE 2.4 ohm (E24 std)\n\nPower @ RDSON=1.45 (worst case):\n  ICB = 3.6 / (2*2.4 + 1.45)\n  ICB = 3.6 / (4.8 + 1.45)\n  ICB = 3.6 / 6.25\n  ICB = 0.5760 A = 576.0 mA\n  P = (0.5760)^2 * 2.4\n  P = 0.33178 * 2.4\n  P = 0.796 W\n\nRESULT: RCB = 2.4 ohm | P = 0.796 W | Min rated power (60% derate) = 0.796/0.6 = 1.327 W"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 182.88 102.87 0)
